    "detailed_description": "In Autofahrt you have to flee alone or with friends from an approaching deadly sandstorm. <br>In a car and with up to 6 players, you drive on a road with many intersections that leads to random locations. <br>Once there, you have to look for resources such as gasoline, tools and spare parts to repair and improve your car.<br>But you have no time to waste, the storm is approaching and there is only one chance to survive, you have to reach the bunker before the storm hits you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Drive your car to randomly placed locations<br></li><li> Search for parts to repair and improve your vehicle<br></li><li> Find new cars and equipment<br></li><li> Host or join a game via Steam with upto 6 players<br></li><li> Ingame communication: Voice chat / chat</li></ul>",
